id=gxr_wear_dim_azj2
name=Galaxy XR wear-aware display blanking (AZJ2)
version=0.2.0-azj2-experimental
versionCode=4
author=booinspace
description=Turns the panel off after 60 seconds without eyes while worn; polls every 16 ms while blanked to restore on eye return. Keeps stock removal sleep. Enable then Action; no Soft restart needed.
